          "prop": "🥁",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Taffy stopped halfway around the music circle.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "surprised",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Percy's drumbeat raced ahead of her feet.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "surprised",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "My ears cannot catch up with that beat!",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "surprised",
              "action": "point"
            },
            {
              "text": "I thought faster music would make faster dancing.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "surprised",
              "action": "point"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "playground",
          "character": "pig",
          "secondCharacter": "bunny",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🥁",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Percy wanted a marching tune for Taffy.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "She had planned four small hopping steps.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "I can play the biggest drum sound here.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            },
            {
              "text": "Then help me hear where each step belongs.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "playground",
          "character": "pig",
          "secondCharacter": "bunny",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🥁",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Percy drummed as quickly as his paws could move.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Taffy tried following with very tiny hops.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "My paws sound like falling popcorn!",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            },
            {
              "text": "My feet feel like they are chasing it.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "playground",
          "character": "pig",
          "secondCharacter": "bunny",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 2,
          "prop": "🥁",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Taffy sat down beside the circle.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "surprised",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Percy stopped when he noticed her still feet.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "surprised",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Why has our march turned into a rest?",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "surprised",
              "action": "nod"
            },
            {
              "text": "Because the beat has run away without me.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "surprised",
              "action": "nod"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "question",
          "background": "playground",
          "character": "pig",
          "secondCharacter": "bunny",
          "energy": "calm",
          "holdSec": 3,
          "prop": "🥁",
          "question": {
            "answer": {
              "text": "Listen first!",
              "emoji": "💡"
            },
            "praise": "Yes! Listen first!"
          },
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Should Percy play over Taffy or listen first?",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "point"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "playground",
          "character": "pig",
          "secondCharacter": "bunny",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🥁",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Percy played only loud beats instead.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "The space between them changed each time.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Now every step has a giant sound.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            },
            {
              "text": "But I cannot guess when the next one comes.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "playground",
          "character": "pig",
          "secondCharacter": "bunny",
          "energy": "calm",
          "holdSec": 2,
          "prop": "🥁",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Taffy showed four evenly spaced little hops.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "surprised",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Percy watched her feet before touching the drum.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "surprised",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Your steps leave the same space each time.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "surprised",
              "action": "nod"
            },
            {
              "text": "That space lets me land before hopping again.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "surprised",
              "action": "nod"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "playground",
          "character": "pig",
          "secondCharacter": "bunny",
          "energy": "calm",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🥁",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Percy tapped a slow beat with one paw.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Taffy answered with one comfortable hop.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tap, and a little room to breathe.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hop, and a little room to land.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "playground",
          "character": "pig",
          "secondCharacter": "bunny",
          "energy": "calm",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🥁",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "They practiced four beats and a pause.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Percy waited while Taffy turned around.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "The quiet bit helps you change direction.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            },
            {
              "text": "And it gives your paws a tiny rest.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "question",
          "background": "playground",
          "character": "pig",
          "secondCharacter": "bunny",
          "energy": "calm",
          "holdSec": 3,
          "prop": "🥁",
          "question": {
            "answer": {
              "text": "Yes!",
              "emoji": "💡"
            },
            "praise": "Yes! Yes!"
          },
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Can a pause be part of a rhythm?",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "point"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "lesson",
          "background": "playground",
          "character": "pig",
          "secondCharacter": "bunny",
          "energy": "calm",
          "holdSec": 2,
          "prop": "🥁",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Percy kept the same easy rhythm.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Taffy marched around the whole circle.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "I can follow every beat you play now!",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            },
            {
              "text": "I can hear your feet joining my drum.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "playground",
          "character": "pig",
          "secondCharacter": "bunny",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🥁",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "They invited two imaginary dancers to their game.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Percy left plenty of space between the beats.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "This tune has room for all our steps.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            },
            {
              "text": "Even for a very small pretend dancer.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "playground",
          "character": "pig",
          "secondCharacter": "bunny",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🥁",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Taffy gave Percy a turn to march.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "She tapped the drum while he circled it.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Now I know how the rhythm feels outside.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            },
            {
              "text": "And I know how it feels inside the drum.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "playground",
          "character": "pig",
          "secondCharacter": "bunny",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 2,
          "prop": "🥁",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "They finished with one soft final tap.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Both friends landed on the same beat.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "That was a march we made together.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            },
            {
              "text": "The quiet spaces were part of the music too.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "happy",
